stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> START_MENU
    START_MENU --> PLAYING : Space on "Start"
    START_MENU --> [*] : Q or "Quit"
    PLAYING --> PAUSED : P
    PAUSED --> PLAYING : P or "Resume"
    PAUSED --> [*] : Q or "Quit"
    PLAYING --> GAME_OVER : PlayerState.lives reaches 0
    PLAYING --> VICTORY : WaveState.waveNumber >= 3
    GAME_OVER --> PLAYING : R resets Player/Score/Wave state
    VICTORY --> PLAYING : R resets Player/Score/Wave state

    note right of PLAYING
        Only in PLAYING and the two
        end states does update() run
        the entity processors.
    end note
